        "rationale": "FINDINGS.md finds the real cause: an older custom `writing-adrs` upload sits one directory below the opaque bucket under `synced/`, and its SKILL.md has no Alternatives considered section. It explains why `ls` missed it, clears the hook and the registry copy with matching md5s, and honestly flags the lock digest as unchecked instead of blaming it."
